SUMMARY:CANCELLED - Dungeons & Dragons Campaign for Adults - The Rifts of Rhim NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nJoin GM Gio for an adventure along the Rifts of Rhim\, a chain 
 of small islands whose physical separations are rivaled only by deep 
 ideological divides. Despite the dangerous waters and tensions between 
 factions\, many daring travelers sail the Rifts in search of glory\, 
 fortune\, friendship\, and adventure. The question remains: what will you 
 discover along the Rifts of Rhim? \n\nImportant Note: Characters will not 
 be created in this class. Participants should arrive with a completed 
 character. If you do not yet have one\, we encourage you to first take 
 Adult Dungeons & Dragons: Create Your Own Character to prepare for the 
 campaign.\n
