 Mah Jongg players!\n\nThe library will provide a set and table! NOTE: 
 Attendees should already have an understanding of the Mah Jongg game. 
 Attendees should bring their 2025 or 2026 National Mah Jongg League card to 
 the meetup. Bringing an additional set is encouraged!\n\nIf you prefer to 
 play the game on the weekend\, please register for the "Mah Jongg Meetup - 
 Weekly Saturday Afternoon" by clicking here\n\nIf you're new to the game\, 
 and would like to teach yourself at your own pace\, please register for the 
 "Teach Yourself Mah Jongg" by clicking here.\n
