SUMMARY:Creative Mending 101 NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nRepair can be joyful! In this hands-on needlework workshop\, 
 we’ll explore simple\, functional mending and embroidery techniques that 
 help extend the life of well-loved clothing. Together\, we’ll cover all 
 the basics and practice essential stitches for hemming\, reverse 
 appliqué\, and an introduction to darning. Led by Teaching Artist Jenny 
 Santa Maria\, this class treats needlework as a caring and creative act. 
 You’ll gain hands-on skills and experience how acts of repair extend 
 beyond fabric and into how we care for one another.\n\n
