SUMMARY:Passport to Pitch: World Cup Futebol Tour
DESCRIPTION:Since the world’s biggest futebol party is happening right 
 now\, let's brush up on our World Cup knowledge\,and world geography. Join 
 us Wednesday's at 3 as we hang out for a weekly World Cup celebration where 
 we'll:\n\n\n	\n	DIY your own "passport" to track where we've been. 
 \n	\n	\n	Meet the superstars of futebol.\n	\n	\n	Get hands-on with cool 
 challenges (like building landmarks like MetLife Stadium out of LEGOs!). 
 \n	\n\n\nIt’s basically a giant party for anyone who loves soccer\, 
 building stuff\, and seeing what the rest of the world is up to. Catch you 
 on the pitch! Registration Required.\n\n
