SUMMARY:Peruvian Cajón  Workshop & Adelina y Amor Opening
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a special participatory workshop demonstrating the beauty 
 of the Peruvian Cajón - a powerful percussive instrument. We will also 
 celebrate the opening of the photo exhibition Adelina y Amor (June 13 - 28) 
 with remarks by Peruvian Consul General\, Minister Gabriela Porras Alor. 
 Adelina y Amor is  a traveling documentary photography exhibition by 
 Peruvian artist Jeannine Ferrand. It honors Afro-Peruvian culture through 
 intimate\, vintage portraits of the late musician/zapateo legend Amador 
 Ballumbrosio\, his wife Adelina\, and their family in the town of El 
 Carmen\, Chincha.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Main - Cafe Area
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Children's Programs, Dance, Lectures / History & Culture, Music
