 fairly proficient speaker. If you’re not sure but interested sign up and 
 take a chance!\n\nOur first title will be The Alchemist by Paulo Coelho. 
 You can request a copy here or email adultprograms@montclairlibrary.org 
 with your library card number and we will reserve a copy for you!\n\nThe 
