SUMMARY:Help Us Build Your Dream Library: Teen Listening Session
DESCRIPTION:If you could change one thing about the Teen Room\, what would 
 it be? What program would actually get you to show up? What's missing?\nWe 
 want the real answers\, and we want them from you. Come tell us what you'd 
 love to see this year in the Teen Room and across our tween and teen 
 programs. Big ideas\, small ideas\, weird ideas\, "why don't you already 
 have this" ideas. Bring all of them.\nGot volunteer paperwork that needs 
 signing? Bring it and staff will take care of it on the spot.\n\nYou earn 3 
 volunteer hours just for showing up and telling us what you 
 think.\n\nRegistration recommended but not required.\n\n
