SUMMARY:Siamese Mah Jongg
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nWhat do you do when you can’t find 3 other players and are 
 tired of playing the Bots online? Learn Siamese Mah Jongg\, a game for 2 
 people! This class is for players who have already taken a beginner class 
 and know the National Mah Jongg League rules.\n\n\nMaterials fee of $9 due 
 to the instructor at class time.
