SUMMARY:Soca - Outdoor Dance Class!
DESCRIPTION:High energy grooves and Caribbean inspired dance moves to new 
 and classic soca tunes. \n\nWith instructor Azriel Wallace.\n\nClass will 
 be held outdoors on the library plaza\, and brought indoors to the 
 auditorium if needed for weather.\n\n“Come Celebrate With Me” is a 
 year-long series of programming honoring 100 years of observing Black 
 history in America. Founded in 1926 by Carter G. Woodson\, Negro History 
 Week evolved into Black History Month\, opening the door for additional 
 annual commemorations such as Juneteenth\, Black Music Month\, Caribbean 
 Heritage Month\, Kwanzaa and more.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Main - Library Plaza
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Dance
