SUMMARY:The Photographer’s Eye: Developing Your Vision
DESCRIPTION:\n	\n		\n			\n			Note: This is a paid Adult School class. Click 
 here to register.\n\n			Photographer’s Eye is a relaxed\, 
 beginner-friendly photography course designed for adults who want to learn 
 how to see and take better pictures—no technical background required. 
 Over two 3-hour sessions (6 hours total)\, we’ll explore the basics of 
 visual storytelling\, composition\, light\, and how photographers make 
 creative choices. Through simple exercises\, discussion\, and image 
 examples\, participants will develop confidence and a stronger 
 “photographic eye.” Any camera is welcome\, including smartphones\, 
 point-and-shoots\, or DSLRs. Perfect for curious beginners and anyone 
 looking to refresh their perspective.\n			\n		\n	\n\n
